OL,3,GNEWSANHS chiefs aim to rebuild trust in
OL,4,Amaternity care
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital bosses have pledged to rebuild
OL,7,Ftrust with families after its maternity
OL,8,Fservices were criticised in a damning
OL,9,Freview.
OL,11,FThe Independent National Maternity and
OL,12,FNeonatal Investigation, published in
OL,13,FJune, found widespread racism and
OL,14,Fdiscrimination at the Sandwell and West
OL,15,FBirmingham Hospitals NHS Trust (SWBH).
OL,17,FFamilies and staff told investigators
OL,18,Fcare was varied based on ethnicity or
OL,19,Fbackground, while researchers reported
OL,20,Fseeing a racist incident among staff
OL,21,Fduring a visit.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
