OL,3,GNEWSANHS chiefs aim to rebuild trust in
OL,4,Amaternity care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust, which runs Midland
OL,7,FMetropolitan University Hospital in
OL,8,FSmethwick, said it was taking steps to
OL,9,Fimprove, including meeting with faith
OL,10,Fgroups, charities and "trusted voices".
